+
+`SHA256SUMS.json` is the portable payload manifest: every key is relative to this directory. `PROVENANCE.json` identifies the authority and qualifications. Materialize binaries with `git lfs pull` before comparing actual bytes. The exact source SHA is761b51a83454f323c4b23e58d67e36d124c86c8f51a9dc6f47893997928867d1.
